            "start": 281,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 5274,
            "html_start": 4956,
            "text": "Register Now  <https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/06e5811c-e7c9-493c-98c2-5f818c3654a2@4532deee-c4ed-44d7-88c6-79ffa513472c?source=copyLinkLegacyShareLinkDialog>"
          },
          {
            "id": 2,
            "end": 581,
            "tag": "p",
            "start": 450,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7071,
            "html_start": 6872,
            "text": "This practical webinar demonstrates how large language models can help people work with real ocean data in the Ocean Data Platform."
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "end": 626,
            "tag": "p",
            "start": 583,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7182,
            "html_start": 7071,
            "text": "Using AI Skills and ODP, we’ll show how to:"
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "end": 693,
            "tag": "li",
            "start": 628,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7352,
            "html_start": 7210,
            "text": "Discover relevant ocean datasets using natural-language questions"
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "end": 738,
            "tag": "li",
            "start": 695,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7472,
            "html_start": 7352,
            "text": "Query, filter, and analyse data through ODP"
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
            "end": 799,
            "tag": "li",
            "start": 740,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7608,
            "html_start": 7472,
            "text": "Turn data and analysis into an interactive map or prototype"
          },
          {
            "id": 7,
            "end": 1024,
            "tag": "p",
            "start": 801,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 7904,
            "html_start": 7613,
            "text": "The session will focus on practical demonstrations of LLM-assisted workflows, including examples of prototypes built with real ODP data. We’ll also discuss how to verify results and develop reliable, reproducible workflows."
          },
          {
            "id": 8,
            "end": 1156,
            "tag": "p",
            "start": 1026,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 8102,
            "html_start": 7904,
            "text": "The webinar is intended for researchers, analysts, developers, and practitioners interested in combining ocean data with AI tools."
          },
          {
            "id": 9,
            "end": 1325,
            "tag": "a",
            "start": 1158,
            "headings": [],
            "html_end": 10272,
            "html_start": 9955,
            "text": "Register Now  <https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/06e5811c-e7c9-493c-98c2-5f818c3654a2@4532deee-c4ed-44d7-88c6-79ffa513472c?source=copyLinkLegacyShareLinkDialog>"
